en:
"Oh ho, I never expected to run into you so suddenly.{w}But tell me, how do you differ from the five primal races?
What was this generational succession even for!"{w}{p}"Come, let us have a little bout, shall we?{w}This power of the Ryug I have heard such rumors of --
show it to me!!"{w}

"D-don't tell Council Chair Wattner
or Mayleen! Please!"{w}{p}"I'll get my pay docked again...{w}If I starved to death out on the street,
you'd feel sorry for me, right? That'd be bad, right? Right!?"{w}
